-- src:8419 | 76DA or 76E;
-- src:8421 | (b) a notice of purchase or acquisition in the prescribed form
-- src:8422 | with the following particulars:
@ref s 76B(7) the private company's purchase by lodging (src:8414-8422)
-- src:8459 | (9) Where a public company purchases or acquires shares issued by
-- src:8460 | it under section 76C, 76D, 76DA or 76E —
-- src:8498 | (c) for the purposes of this section, shares are deemed to be
-- src:8499 | purchased or acquired on the date on which the company
-- src:8500 | would, apart from subsection (5), become entitled to
-- src:8501 | exercise the rights attached to the shares.
@ref s 76B(9)(c) the date the shares are deemed purchased (src:8459-8501)
-- src:8939 | 76F.—(1) A payment made by a company in consideration of —
-- src:8941 | (a) acquiring any right with respect to the purchase or
-- src:8942 | acquisition of its own shares in accordance with
-- src:8943 | section 76C, 76D, 76DA or 76E;
-- src:8953 | may be made out of the company’s capital or profits so long as the
-- src:8954 | company is solvent.
@ref s 76F(1) the payment may be made so long as the company is solvent (src:8939-8954)
-- src:8962 | (2) If the requirements in subsection (1) are not satisfied in relation
-- src:8963 | to an agreement —
-- src:8965 | (a) in a case within subsection (1)(a) — no purchase or
