GIVEN company IS A Party
      directors IS A Party
      `the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares are cancelled under section 76B(5) and not held in treasury under section 76H` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is solvent at the date of the payment` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the purchase or acquisition is a selective off-market purchase` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares that are the subject of the selective off-market purchase belong to a particular class of shares and do not constitute all the shares in that class` IS A BOOLEAN
