      `the consent was obtained before the special resolution was passed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date of the meeting at which the resolution is passed` IS A DATE
      `the day from which the copy or memorandum has been continuously available for inspection by members at the company's registered office until the date of the meeting` IS A DATE
      `the copy or memorandum is available for inspection by members at the meeting itself` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date specified in the notice on which the authority is to expire` IS A DATE
      `the date the next annual general meeting is held` IS A DATE
      `the date the next annual general meeting is required by law to be held` IS A DATE
      `the period of all convenient speed, as found` IS A NUMBER @desc The days that make up all convenient speed for this duty, found by whoever applies the rule; there is no default (Interpretation Act 1965 s 52)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `share buy-back act`
`s 76D the company passes a special resolution authorising a selective off-market purchase and the lodging and the purchase follow` MEANS
    IF `s 76D(1) the company may make a selective off-market purchase or acquisition of its own shares` `the purchase or acquisition is a selective off-market purchase` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN (IF `s 76D(2A) the company has obtained the consent the subsection requires before passing the special resolution` `the shares that are the subject of the selective off-market purchase belong to a particular class of shares and do not constitute all the shares in that class` `the number of holders of shares of that class, excluding any person whose shares are proposed to be purchased or acquired and the person's associated persons` `the number of those holders who have consented to the terms of the agreement` `the consent was obtained before the special resolution was passed` EQUALS JUST FALSE
          THEN PARTY company
               SHANT `s 76D(2) pass the special resolution authorising the terms of the agreement`
               HENCE FULFILLED
               LEST BREACH BY company BECAUSE "the company passed the special resolution without having obtained, before passing it, the consent of at least 75% of the holders of the shares of the class that section 76D(2A) requires"
          ELSE (IF    (`s 76D(7) the special resolution is effective as far as the inspection requirement goes` `the date of the meeting at which the resolution is passed` `the day from which the copy or memorandum has been continuously available for inspection by members at the company's registered office until the date of the meeting` `the copy or memorandum is available for inspection by members at the meeting itself` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
                   AND `s 76C(2)(c) the expiry date is not later than the date of the next annual general meeting` `the date specified in the notice on which the authority is to expire` `the date the next annual general meeting is held` `the date the next annual general meeting is required by law to be held`
                THEN PARTY company
                     MAY `s 76D(2) pass the special resolution authorising the terms of the agreement`
                     HENCE (`s 76B(9)(a) after the resolution the directors of a public company lodge its copy and the company purchases within the authority` company directors `the company is a public company` `the shares are cancelled under section 76B(5) and not held in treasury under section 76H` ((DATE_SERIAL `the date specified in the notice on which the authority is to expire`) MINUS (DATE_SERIAL `the date of the meeting at which the resolution is passed`)) `the company is solvent at the date of the payment` `the period of all convenient speed, as found`)
                ELSE PARTY company
                     MAY `s 76D(2) pass the special resolution authorising the terms of the agreement`
                     HENCE FULFILLED))
    ELSE FULFILLED

