§ `Sections 76I(3) and 76K(1D): the excess treasury shares`

-- TIMELINE: unit=calendar day; day 0=the day on which the contravention of s 76I(1) or (2) occurs; counting="before the end of the period of 6 months beginning with the day on which that contravention occurs, or such further period as the Registrar may allow": the day of the contravention is day 1 of the 6 months (sg-periods P10), so the period ends the day before the same date 6 months on, the last day being in time, and n is DATE_SERIAL of that last day minus DATE_SERIAL of the day of the contravention, computed here from the DATE inputs; where the Registrar has allowed a further period the caller states its last day and n runs to it; the public company's notice then runs "within 30 days after the cancellation or disposal" from the day of the cancellation or disposal (through HENCE), the integer line being the count of days (P1, P2)
-- FORK: s 76I(3) | "before the end of the period" is read as on or before the last day of the 6 months | strictly before the last day
-- FORK: s 76I(3) | the Registrar's further period is an input fixed before the chain starts (a flag and a last day), because the text names no day by which the Registrar must allow it | the allowance as a step of the Registrar after the 6 months lapse
-- FORK: s 76K(1D) | a private company has no step after the cancellation or disposal: s 76K(1A) says it may cancel or dispose by lodging a notice, a means with no time and no duty | the private company's lodging as a MUST with no clock
-- src:9086 | (3) Where subsection (1) or (2) is contravened by a company, the
-- src:9087 | company must dispose of or cancel the excess shares in accordance
-- src:9088 | with section 76K before the end of the period of 6 months beginning
-- src:9089 | with the day on which that contravention occurs, or such further
-- src:9090 | period as the Registrar may allow.
@ref s 76I(3) the disposal or cancellation of the excess shares (src:9086-9090)
-- src:9197 | (1D) Where a public company cancels or disposes treasury shares
-- src:9198 | in accordance with subsection (1C), the directors of the company
-- src:9199 | must lodge with the Registrar a prescribed notice of the cancellation
-- src:9200 | or disposal of treasury shares together with the prescribed fee within
-- src:9201 | 30 days after the cancellation or disposal of treasury shares.
@ref s 76K(1D) the public company's notice of the cancellation or disposal (src:9197-9201)
GIVEN company IS A Party
      directors IS A Party
      `the company is a public company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company has shares of only one class` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the aggregate number of shares held as treasury shares` IS A NUMBER
      `the total number of shares of the company at that time, treasury shares included` IS A NUMBER
      `the share capital of the company is divided into shares of different classes` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the aggregate number of the shares of the class held as treasury shares` IS A NUMBER
      `the total number of the shares in that class at that time, treasury shares included` IS A NUMBER
      `the day on which the contravention occurs` IS A DATE
      `the Registrar has allowed a further period` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the last day of the further period the Registrar has allowed` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `share buy-back act`
`s 76I(3) the company must dispose of or cancel the excess treasury shares before the end of the 6 months and a public company's directors then lodge the notice` MEANS
    IF    (`s 76I(1) the number of shares held as treasury shares exceeds the limit` `the company has shares of only one class` `the aggregate number of shares held as treasury shares` `the total number of shares of the company at that time, treasury shares included` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
       OR (`s 76I(2) the number of shares of the class held as treasury shares exceeds the limit` `the share capital of the company is divided into shares of different classes` `the aggregate number of the shares of the class held as treasury shares` `the total number of the shares in that class at that time, treasury shares included` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
    THEN PARTY company
         MUST `s 76I(3) dispose of or cancel the excess shares in accordance with section 76K`
         WITHIN (IF `the Registrar has allowed a further period`
                 THEN (DATE_SERIAL `the last day of the further period the Registrar has allowed`) MINUS (DATE_SERIAL `the day on which the contravention occurs`)
                 ELSE (DATE_SERIAL (`period: the last day of a period beginning with` `the day on which the contravention occurs` 6 Months)) MINUS (DATE_SERIAL `the day on which the contravention occurs`))
         HENCE (`s 76K(1D) after the cancellation or disposal the directors of a public company lodge the prescribed notice` directors `the company is a public company`)
         LEST BREACH BY company BECAUSE "the company did not dispose of or cancel the excess treasury shares before the end of the period of 6 months beginning with the day on which the limit was exceeded, or the further period the Registrar allowed"
    ELSE FULFILLED
